     "result_text_tail": " as the add-on. Margin still holds at 75.3% even if every Pro account used that much.\n\n**Choices I made for you**\n- **Audience:** the CEO and executive team approving or rejecting the plan.\n- **Storyline:** approved as drafted, since you weren't available.\n- **Allowance:** 600 requests per seat per month is my recommended design, not a figure from the pack. It sits just above the beta average of 444 per seat.\n\n**Limits to know about**\n- The 33% Pro take-up comes from a 2023 tier that didn't include AI. Take-up is the input the case depends on most.\n- The pack doesn't say how much mobile churn the rewrite would fix, or how long the rewrite takes.\n- The plan with the rewrite first assumes it takes two quarters.\n- Two minor warnings remain on the timing slide (page 16). Its text is slightly long, and one sidebar figure is an input to the chart rather than a reading of it; it's needed to show how the bars are built.\n- I couldn't preview the slides as images because no PowerPoint converter is installed here. I checked the rendered text and chart values instead, and the renderer reports no overflow, but give the deck a quick look in PowerPoint.\n\nPossible next steps: add Q4 2026 win-rate data when it's in, try a different price or allowance, or switch the theme.\n\nFiles are in `./deliverable/`:\n- `brightwork-dispatch-copilot.pptx`\n- `brightwork-dispatch-copilot-sources.xlsx` (each number's source, excerpt and live formula)\n- `brightwork-dispatch-copilot.json` (the editable deck spec)"
